Hi {Owner},

I build websites for party and event rental companies around {City}. {Business Name} has great tent and table setups on its social pages, but no catalogue where a host can check a date and reserve.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: your tents, tables, chairs and linens with day rates, a tent sizing guide, delivery zones and a reservation form that takes a deposit, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, price changes and new inventory. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone before the trucks go out one morning?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
